# App-server protocol (v2)

JSON-RPC over WebSocket/stdio/Unix socket.

- Methods: `<resource>/<method>` with singular resource names
- Payloads: `*Params`, `*Response`, `*Notification`
- Wire fields: camelCase (`#[serde(rename_all = "camelCase")]`), except config RPCs (snake_case)
- TypeScript: `#[ts(export_to = "v2/")]` on all RPC types
- **New API surface goes in v2 only, never v1**
- Never use `#[serde(skip_serializing_if = "Option::is_none")]` on v2 API types

After protocol changes: `just write-app-server-schema` (add `--experimental` if needed).

See root `AGENTS.md` for full v2 development best practices.
